libri,Helvetica,sans-serif\" color=\"black\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:12pt\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><font size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,EmojiFont,Apple Color Emoji,Segoe UI Emoji,NotoColorEmoji,Segoe UI Symbol,Android Emoji,EmojiSymbols\" color=\"black\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:12pt\"></span></font></div>\r\n</span></font><font size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif\" color=\"black\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:12pt\"></span></font><font size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,EmojiFont,Apple Color Emoji,Segoe UI Emoji,NotoColorEmoji,Segoe UI Symbol,Android Emoji,EmojiSymbols\" color=\"black\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:12pt\"><br>\r\n</span></font>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"><font size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,EmojiFont,Apple Color Emoji,Segoe UI Emoji,NotoColorEmoji,Segoe UI Symbol,Android Emoji,EmojiSymbols\" color=\"black\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:12pt\">-- numClusters=1 (S_Dbw validity index (Both):    0.0652) </span></font><font size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif\" color=\"black\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:12pt\"></span></font></p><font size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif\" color=\"black\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><font size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,EmojiFont,Apple Color Emoji,Segoe UI Emoji,NotoColorEmoji,Segoe UI Symbol,Android Emoji,EmojiSymbols\" color=\"black\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:12pt\">\r\n<div> <br>\r\n</div>\r\n</span></font></div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><font size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,EmojiFont,Apple Color Emoji,Segoe UI Emoji,NotoColorEmoji,Segoe UI Symbol,Android Emoji,EmojiSymbols\" color=\"black\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:12pt\">-- numClusters=2 (S_Dbw validity index (Both):    0.0545) <br>\r\n</span></font></div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><font size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,EmojiFont,Apple Color Emoji,Segoe UI Emoji,NotoColorEmoji,Segoe UI Symbol,Android Emoji,EmojiSymbols\" color=\"black\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:12pt\"><br>\r\n</span></font></div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><font size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,EmojiFont,Apple Color Emoji,Segoe UI Emoji,NotoColorEmoji,Segoe UI Symbol,Android Emoji,EmojiSymbols\" color=\"black\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:12pt\">although\r\n the difference in S_Dbw validity index_Both is so small, I believe that\r\n i shall select numClusters=2 for downstream analysis.</span></font></div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><font size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,EmojiFont,Apple Color Emoji,Segoe UI Emoji,NotoColorEmoji,Segoe UI Symbol,Android Emoji,EmojiSymbols\" color=\"black\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:12pt\"><br>\r\n</span></font></div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><font size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,EmojiFont,Apple Color Emoji,Segoe UI Emoji,NotoColorEmoji,Segoe UI Symbol,Android Emoji,EmojiSymbols\" color=\"black\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:12pt\">however,\r\n when I look at the CNA/LOH predictions, I can see huge differences in \r\nCNV predictions for many chromosomes between numClusters=1 and \r\nnumClusters=2. <br>\r\n</span></font></div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><font size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,EmojiFont,Apple Color Emoji,Segoe UI Emoji,NotoColorEmoji,Segoe UI Symbol,Android Emoji,EmojiSymbols\" color=\"black\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:12pt\"><br>\r\n</span></font></div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><font size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,EmojiFont,Apple Color Emoji,Segoe UI Emoji,NotoColorEmoji,Segoe UI Symbol,Android Emoji,EmojiSymbols\" color=\"black\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:12pt\">when\r\n you have a minutes to skim through png files\r\n : for example, considering chr3 or chr4, some areas are called HET or \r\nDLOH, HET or GAIN shall we consider numClusters=1  or numClusters=2 \r\n(that have a very small difference of 0.01 in S_Dbw validity index ). <br>\r\n</span></font></div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><font size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,EmojiFont,Apple Color Emoji,Segoe UI Emoji,NotoColorEmoji,Segoe UI Symbol,Android Emoji,EmojiSymbols\" color=\"black\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:12pt\"><br>\r\n</span></font></div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><font size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,EmojiFont,Apple Color Emoji,Segoe UI Emoji,NotoColorEmoji,Segoe UI Symbol,Android Emoji,EmojiSymbols\" color=\"black\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:12pt\">is it an expected result ? Any comments and suggestions are very much welcome. Thanks a lot !</span></font></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><font size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,EmojiFont,Apple Color Emoji,Segoe UI Emoji,NotoColorEmoji,Segoe UI Symbol,Android Emoji,EmojiSymbols\" color=\"black\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:12pt\"><br></span></font></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><font size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,EmojiFont,Apple Color Emoji,Segoe UI Emoji,NotoColorEmoji,Segoe UI Symbol,Android Emoji,EmojiSymbols\" color=\"black\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:12pt\">-- bogdan<br></span></font></div></font>"
